1. Age ≥ 18 years old, male or female;
2. Phase I trials select pathologically confirmed recurrent central nervous system tumors (including but not limited to anaplastic astrocytoma, anaplastic oligoastrocytoma, glioblastoma, gliosarcoma, anaplastic ependymoma, Medulloblastoma, malignant meningioma, melanoma, etc.) postoperative patients; Phase IIa trial selects postoperative patients with pathologically confirmed recurrent glioblastoma
3. KPS score ≥60;
